Negative control for session-template.test.ts.

Declares the pick with the right-hand two-column layout as its fallback, so a
brand with no template, an empty one, or a name the page does not lay out gets
that instead of the left-hand two-column layout. Every named template still
draws its own layout.

Intended RED (session-template.test.ts, "sessionTemplate"):
  draws the left-hand two-column layout for no template
  draws the left-hand two-column layout for an empty template
  draws the left-hand two-column layout for a template only other pages carry
  draws the left-hand two-column layout for a name no layout carries
  draws the left-hand two-column layout for a name every object inherits
Intended GREEN:
  draws the layout the <each> template carries

